---
// Output sits below a <CLI> in the same flow, styled as dimmed mono with subtle indent.
---

<pre class="cli-output"><slot /></pre>

<style>
  .cli-output {
    margin: -10px 0 18px;
    padding: 12px 18px 12px 36px;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-top: 0;
    border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    overflow-x: auto;
    white-space: pre;
  }
</style>
